theorem reviewShimmer (Y:Supplier)(d η:ℝ)(e:0<η)(y:ℕ→ℕ):∃ (P:Spine)(K:P.Register), uniform P K Y d η∧GeometrySharp P.par ∧ BoltCharge P.run ∧ ∃ (R:P.Roster) (M:Pitching.Focus.Morn P.par.K)(α:ℝ)(F:ℕ)(C D:ℕ→ℕ→ℝ)(c r:ℕ→ℕ)(x:P.Spectrum0 3)(J:P.Ellis 3 x)(s n:ℕ)(a:ℝ)(U G:SampleDose)(B:P.Experiment K c r x J),Reader P M α ∧ y≤r ∧
    P.ReturnsSix x s n a U G ∧ P.FixedSatinReadings K x s n a U G ∧ served U G ∧
    (∀ᶠ s:ℕ in atTop,∀ᶠ i in atTop,∀ k:ℕ,(P.run.voyage i).kick≤k→s≤P.run.uv k → Charcoal P.run s i k α M.Mult) ∧ P.CapFoam R M α ∧
    (∀ s,F ≤ s → Accolade P M α F s (C s) (D s)) ∧ (∀ s,F ≤ s → Accordance P M F s (C s) (D s)) ∧ RobeRoad P F C D x ∧ Jones P M α F C D x∧ (∀ {V:Type}[NormedAddCommGroup V][NormedSpace ℂ V],∀ᶠ d:ℕ in atTop,let j:= hikeV d; ∀ m:P.ColorHil 3 x→L[ℂ] V, ‖m‖≤1→
 Tendsto (fun i:ℕ=>m (recoup P F C D x i j)) atTop (𝓝 0) →∀ s:ℕ,
 ‖m (sparrow P F x (j+s) j)‖ ≤ 2*((2/ThinGauge.boost (Xη P.par.R.L))^s*(2^d*(2*ranch P M α j))))∧
    (∀ s,F ≤ s →  basket P.par.R.L C D F s≠ 0) ∧ Tendsto (tidal P F) atTop (𝓝 (0:ℝ))∧
    (∀ᶠ j in atTop,∀ i k,(P.run.voyage i).kick≤k→j≤P.run.uv k→ closeDen P.run j i k)∧ (∀ μ:ℝ,∀ᶠ s in atTop,∀ i k:ℕ,s≤P.run.uv k→ pressureLean P.run μ s i k)∧ ∀ Z:Lead.Clan, Tour B Z F C D U G :=by
 obtain ⟨δ0,t0,v,x0,v0,hv,v'⟩:= Checkers.warm 4 (by omega)
 obtain ⟨W,hW,hc⟩:= grantH 4 (by omega)
 let μ: Supplier:=fun i j l p a b c d e f g h => max ((W+1)*180*(1+v)) (Y i j l p a b c d e f g h)
 obtain ⟨P,K,h,Rs,geo,⟨G,M,A,t₀,t₁,Q,x,X,a,b,p,r,u,j,R⟩, -⟩:= epochMars μ d (min η δ0) (lt_min e x0) y
 obtain ⟨k₀,v₁,r₀,z₁,z₂,q₀,g₁,tq⟩:=h.1.paper
 have ha:uniform P K Y d η:= ⟨{h.1 with walls:=h.1.walls.trans (min_le_left ..),paper:=⟨_,_,_,_,_,q₀,g₁,(le_max_right ..).trans tq⟩},h.2⟩
 have cD:=Papal.close_denominator P.run geo
 have hp:=copper P.run (h.1.walls.trans (min_le_right ..)) x0 hv hW v0 v' hc ((le_max_left ..).trans tq) cD A M.Mult
 let hf:= gainsCap P Rs M A R hp
