 obtain ⟨r,w,c,x,hx,J,B'⟩:= Prototype.electorAE P K X ((redemption P F C D M bZ).and (reader_E P M b₀)) h y
 let W':=trans6 B'
 let o:Orders:= ⟨fun _=>true,rfl⟩; have hs: reviewEarlierBox.Later reviewLaterBox o 0:=by intro j; norm_num [Doorway.Later,reviewEarlierBox,reviewLaterBox,o]
 let bs:Fin 3→Bool:=fun _=>false; obtain ⟨p,e,he,u,z⟩:= authorize bs
 obtain ⟨i,_,a,Fx,Gx,hF,hG,hR,hU,hV,_⟩ := (packs_within_rectangles W' (Metric.ball p e) bs z reviewEarlierBox reviewLaterBox o hs).exists
 refine ⟨P,K,ha,geo,(earns_foil P.run (h.1.walls.trans (min_le_right ..)) x0 hv hW v0 v' hc ((le_max_left ..).trans tq) cD),Rs,M,A,F,C,D,c,r,x,J,c i,r i,a,Fx,Gx,B',R,w,hR,P.reviewWardContrast K x _ _ _ _ _ hR,⟨hF,hG,hU,hV⟩,hp,hf,b₀,bZ,hx.1,hx.2,fun {V h1 h2}=> annihilates P M F C D x hx.2 (fun s i=> (bZ s i).1),?_,recessVanish P F,cD,Papal.prong_first P.run,fun Z=> sealed B' Z F C D Fx Gx M bZ hx.1 ⟨hF,hG,hU,hV⟩⟩
 exact fun s e=> (basket_price _ _ _ _ (fun s e=> bZ s e|>.1) e).2

